{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-cavalli-estates-villas","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"damac-cavalli-estates-villas-in-damac-hills-84","about":"Cavalli Estates Villas at DAMAC Hills presents an elite collection of 6- and 7-bedroom ultra-luxury villas, crafted in collaboration with the world-renowned Italian fashion brand Roberto Cavalli. From marble-clad finishes and gold accents to bespoke interior details, every corner of these villas radiates glamour, style, and sophistication.Each residence is thoughtfully designed to reflect the legacy of Cavalli—featuring functional yet luxurious layouts with spacious living areas flooded with natural light. Floor-to-ceiling panoramic windows frame captivating views of the lush Trump International Golf Club. The outdoor space is equally impressive, featuring a private swimming pool, jacuzzi, yoga zone, and dedicated barbecue and seating areas for elegant alfresco entertaining.Nestled within the prestigious DAMAC Hills community, Cavalli Estates by DAMAC Properties offers residents unrivaled convenience with proximity to premium shopping centers, gourmet restaurants, reputable schools, and everyday essentials. Cavalli Estates Villas is the ultimate choice for those who seek statement-making design, spacious living, and an immersive lifestyle defined by luxury.","price":19378000,"title":"Cavalli Estates Villas","bitrix":{"id":402,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"Cavalli Estates Villas","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Cavalli Estates Villas","property_type":"Villas","developer_name":"DAMAC Properties","project_location":"DAMAC Hills"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Cavalli_Estates_Damac_Hills_Villas_for_Sale_by_Damac_93b86968ab.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/Cavalli_Estates_Damac_Hills_Villas_for_Sale_by_Damac_93b86968ab.webp"}],"status":"ready","_geo